wnload_url":"https://github.com/ReloadLightly/swarm-societies/releases/download/commons-v3-foundation-2026-10-07/commons-v3-foundation-v2.json"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ReloadLightly/swarm-societies/releases/assets/618492791","id":618492791,"node_id":"RA_kwDOU77A584k3XN3","name":"commons-v3-foundation-v2.tar.gz","label":"","uploader":{"login":"ReloadLightly","id":56701666,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2NzAxNjY2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56701666?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ReloadLightly","html_url":"https://github.com/ReloadLightly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ReloadLightly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ReloadLightly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ReloadLightly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ReloadLightly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ReloadLightly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ReloadLightly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ReloadLightly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ReloadLightly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ReloadLightly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-gtar","state":"uploaded","size":4709686,"digest":"sha256:b8bd2e1d383d447cd30b5737e90d86990fffef0cf70281a6100a9ad0c5afab20","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-07T11:29:53Z","updated_at":"2026-10-07T11:30:07Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/ReloadLightly/swarm-societies/releases/download/commons-v3-foundation-2026-10-07/commons-v3-foundation-v2.tar.gz"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ReloadLightly/swarm-societies/tarball/commons-v3-foundation-2026-10-07","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ReloadLightly/swarm-societies/zipball/commons-v3-foundation-2026-10-07","body":"The v3 physical foundation implements mobile individuals, local observation and access, stock-dependent resource renewal, material costs, flow accounting and deterministic physical snapshots. Institutions, membership and political transitions remain future work.\n\nThis release preserves both exploratory development banks: 56 configurations and 224 episodes per bank, using the same four seeds. V1 exposed a numerical return-fuel trap; the separately versioned v2 policy repairs it. The scientific qualification gate remains open. Weak foraging and storage choices still affect consumption, and the reference focal private gain comes entirely from terminal inventory. These comparisons do not establish a robust commons dilemma or a benefit from institutions.\n\nAssets contain 112 compressed case files (9,287,035 original bytes). Designs, summaries, source snapshots, recorded-data figures and validation records remain in Git. There were zero experimental model calls and zero evolutionary runs. Earlier studies and historical Git commits are unchanged.\n\nRestore both banks from a checkout of this release or later:\n\n```bash\npython3 scripts/restore_evidence_v1.py --catalog artifacts/commons-v3-foundation-v1/catalog.json --study all\n```\n\nThe catalog pins archive and per-file SHA-256 digests. Hosting is administratively mutable; changed evidence requires a new archive identity. See `docs/commons-v3-foundation-v1.md` for results, limitations and semantic replay commands.\n"}